frozen `witnessUpper` misses their certificate by 19–27 orders of magnitude
(measured in `TABLE_TRANSCRIPTION_REPORT.md`), because the low kernel carries the
tilt factor `exp (slope · affine)` that the generator expends on both sides of
its own comparison.  `isLow` marks those rows so the gap is visible in Lean.
