envelope (the retained-maximum affine prefix), so the certificate margin
`witnessUpper j * hq ≤ faceUpper j` is a `norm_num` fact about the table.  For
the 64 `.low` rows no such envelope is recorded and the margin is false of
`witnessUpper` — see `TABLE_TRANSCRIPTION_REPORT.md`. -/

